# Figure S21: cross-sections of the 4 x 8, 4 x 9 and 4 x 10 DF(I)NKF maps with their models (central layer).
# Run in ChimeraX from a folder that contains the final models (8x4_Final.cif, 9x4_Final.cif, 10x4_Final.cif)
# and the unsharpened maps (I_8x4_map.mrc, I_9x4_map.mrc, I_10x4_map.mrc):
#   cd <that folder>
#   open make_figS21.cxc
# Map: mesh at 3.5 sigma, shown within 2.2 A of the central-layer atoms. The panels were assembled in Illustrator.
# ---- 8x4 ----
close session
set bgColor white
graphics silhouettes false
lighting soft
camera ortho
open "I_8x4_map.mrc"
open 8x4_Final.cif
hide #2 atoms
hide #2 cartoons
show #2/N6,c5,S5,V4,K5,D5,E5,b5,d5,C5,F5,Q6,a5,I4,P7,X3,e5,L5,U4,B5,T5,G5,M6,Z5,O6,J5,W4,R5,A5,f5,Y6,H6 atoms
style #2 stick
size #2 stickRadius 0.25
color #2 byhetero
color #2 & C #a0286e
color #2 & I #8a2be2
volume #1 style mesh color #5a5a5a sdLevel 3.5 step 1 squareMesh false meshLighting false
volume zone #1 nearAtoms #2/N6,c5,S5,V4,K5,D5,E5,b5,d5,C5,F5,Q6,a5,I4,P7,X3,e5,L5,U4,B5,T5,G5,M6,Z5,O6,J5,W4,R5,A5,f5,Y6,H6 range 2.2
view initial #1,2
# the 4 x 8 structure is viewed from the opposite end of the fibril, so that all cross-sections have the same orientation
turn y 180 models #1,2 center 166.51,166.54,178.05 coordinateSystem #2
windowsize 1200 1000
view #2/N6,c5,S5,V4,K5,D5,E5,b5,d5,C5,F5,Q6,a5,I4,P7,X3,e5,L5,U4,B5,T5,G5,M6,Z5,O6,J5,W4,R5,A5,f5,Y6,H6
zoom pixelSize 0.18
save S21_8x4.png width 3600 height 3000 supersample 3
# ---- 9x4 ----
close session
set bgColor white
graphics silhouettes false
lighting soft
camera ortho
open "I_9x4_map.mrc"
open 9x4_Final.cif
hide #2 atoms
hide #2 cartoons
show #2/Db,Dx,De,Cm,DS,Dc,Dg,Da,DI,Dh,Du,Dt,Ce,Cz,Cf,Dd,Df,DH,EM,DW,DO,CK,Di,Cd,D1,Eb,Cy,Dz,Dj,EL,DX,Cl,Cv,DT,EK,Dq atoms
style #2 stick
size #2 stickRadius 0.25
color #2 byhetero
color #2 & C #a0286e
color #2 & I #8a2be2
volume #1 style mesh color #5a5a5a sdLevel 3.5 step 1 squareMesh false meshLighting false
volume zone #1 nearAtoms #2/Db,Dx,De,Cm,DS,Dc,Dg,Da,DI,Dh,Du,Dt,Ce,Cz,Cf,Dd,Df,DH,EM,DW,DO,CK,Di,Cd,D1,Eb,Cy,Dz,Dj,EL,DX,Cl,Cv,DT,EK,Dq range 2.2
view initial #1,2
windowsize 1200 1000
view #2/Db,Dx,De,Cm,DS,Dc,Dg,Da,DI,Dh,Du,Dt,Ce,Cz,Cf,Dd,Df,DH,EM,DW,DO,CK,Di,Cd,D1,Eb,Cy,Dz,Dj,EL,DX,Cl,Cv,DT,EK,Dq
zoom pixelSize 0.18
save S21_9x4.png width 3600 height 3000 supersample 3
