view #2/X5,E5,N5,j5,a6,Q4,d7,i5,F5,K6,U4,T3,D5,k5,h5,G5,S3,V4,L6,c7,C5,l5,P4,Z6,Y5,O5,H5,e4,g5,J4,B5,M5,W5,b6,m5,R4,I5,n6,A6,f5
zoom pixelSize 0.18
save S21_10x4.png width 3600 height 3000 supersample 3
close session
windowsize 900 550
